  <!-- EN: acidbulb -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.label>腐蚀瘤兽</FH_Acidbulb.label>
  <!-- EN: TODO. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.description>一种因腐蚀性体液而膨胀的巨型瘤状血肉兽。它会用多条触手撕扯近身敌人，并从远处喷射腐蚀性酸液。</FH_Acidbulb.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Launch an acid mortar shell at long range or spray sticky acid over a target area. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>远距离发射酸蚀迫击炮弹，或向目标区域喷吐黏稠酸液。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic abilities: acid mortar and acid spray -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生能力：酸蚀迫击炮与酸液喷吐</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -1; Toxic Resistance +100%; grants acid mortar and acid spray abilities. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-1；毒抗+100%；提供“酸蚀迫击炮”和“酸液喷吐”主动能力。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
