  <!-- EN: bulbfreak -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.label>恶臭瘤兽</FH_Bulbfreak.label>
  <!-- EN: A horrid oozing amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts, all controlled by a linked nervous system. It has two large claws which it uses to tear through its victims. Bulbfreaks are often smelled before they are seen, giving off an overwhelming odor of rancid meat. They are relatively slow and easy to kill, but once they die, they explode into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.description>由许多小型血肉兽组成的可怕混合体，这些血肉兽都由同一个神经系统控制。它长着两只大爪子，可以撕碎受害者。恶臭瘤兽散发着一股令人作呕的腐臭，在看到它本体之前，往往会先闻到这种恶心的味道。它的行动相对缓慢，也很容易被消灭，死后会分裂成一群小型血肉兽。</FH_Bulbfreak.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Two tentacles deal 10 blunt damage with a 2-second cooldown. The active ability consumes 200 twisted flesh to release two random medium fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>两条触手造成10点钝击伤害，冷却时间为2秒。主动能力消耗200扭曲肉，释放两只随机中型血肉兽。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic weapons: tentacles and release fleshbeasts -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生武器：触手与释放血肉兽</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -1; Global Work Speed +20%; twisted flesh capacity +200; grants two tentacles and the release fleshbeasts ability. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-1；全局工作效率+20%；扭曲肉容量+200；提供两条触手和“释放血肉兽”主动能力。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
