  <!-- EN: Fingerspike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.label>独爪兽</FH_Fingerspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshy dog-sized creature with a single spiked limb. Despite their short legs, fingerspikes can move remarkably fast. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.description>长着一根带尖刺触手的血肉兽，体型与犬类动物相当。尽管独爪兽的腿很短，但移动速度非常快。</FH_Fingerspike.description>
