  <!-- EN: fleshwind -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.label>翼爪兽</FH_Fleshwind.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshbeast with huge spiked flying wings and a head covered in sharp keratinous plating. It is roughly the size of an adult human. Its loose, shifting structure allows it to fly through the air and quickly cross defensive fortifications. Fleshwind bodies are often host to smaller fleshbeasts; when the host dies, these parasites tear free, act independently, and attack. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.description>一种长有巨大骨刺飞翼、头部覆盖锋利角质甲片的血肉兽，体型接近成年人。它松散而不断变形的身体结构使其能够飞越空中，迅速跨过防御工事。翼爪兽体内常寄宿着更小的血肉兽；宿主死亡后，这些寄生体会撕开躯体脱离，独立行动并发起攻击。</FH_Fleshwind.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
